                "text_pp7mNy": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>To work with nature’s most precious materials, formed over eons deep within the earth, is—put simply—an honor. We believe that each stone shines with its own light, whether it is a flawless white diamond or a hazy azure sapphire, rich with inclusions. Where some might see imperfection, we see unique beauty, which is why our collections include an array of precious and semi-precious gemstones and colored diamonds, from white, champagne and yellow, to grey and black.</p>",
